<!--
DESERT_FAMILY_PORT_EXECUTION_1 - MISC batch, flora. 7 of the batch's 8 plant
rows ported; AB_GiantStikehr EXCLUDED per the item's own note (cut from the
Extreme Desert the same day as misplaced, not part of this port - do not
re-add it). Source: Alpha Biomes (1841354677, incl. its Odyssey submod for
AB_DessertTree) and ReGrowth 2 (2260097569). Single-view (non-directional),
matching vanilla plant convention. RG_Plant_CrimsonCushion's donor parent
(RG_CarpetScrubsBase, a ReGrowth-internal abstract) is flattened directly onto
PlantBase here rather than porting the abstract; AB_Aaklac's visualSizeRange
was not set by the donor (it inherits BushBase's own default, which the
census could not resolve either - "UNMEASURED") so 0.7~1.0 is AUTHORED here
as a plausible growth curve, not carried from the donor.
Dropped: VEF.Plants.DualCropExtension on AB_DessertTree (secondary dessert-item
output tied to VanillaExpanded.VCookE, donor framework) - the tree still yields
wood on harvest per its inherited TreeBase behaviour.

TEXPATH NOTE (validate_patch.py, live-scanned run, 2026-09-20): five of these seven
plants' own donor texPaths (AB_HardyGrass's "Grass_Leafless", and ReGrowth's
RG_DesertGrass/RG_CreepStern/RG_TundraScrubsRed/RG_Dervish) do NOT exist as
loose files anywhere under the donor mods on disk - CONFIRMED by find, not
guessed - matching this batch's own MISC.json census, which had already
flagged RG_Plant_AridGrass/CreepStern/CrimsonCushion/Dervish "art UNRESOLVED
(no loose PNG and no bundle_textures cache entry)": that donor art is packed
inside a Unity AssetBundle, not a copyable loose PNG. Per the item's own rule
("point texPath at the donor's existing texture...so nothing renders
magenta"), there is no donor loose file to point at for these five, so they
instead point at Alpha Biomes' AB_Aaklac texture (CONFIRMED present on disk,
already used correctly by RSW_VellaraBloom below) as a deliberately MISMATCHED
but non-magenta placeholder - loudly commented at each site. RSW_Scrubgrass's
broken path was not flagged by the validator run (a validator gap, not
evidence the path is good) but was fixed here on the same evidence.
-->
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
		<defName>RSW_Dunegrass</defName>
		<label>dune grass</label>
		<description>Wild grass. Grows anywhere there is a little light and minimally fertile ground.</description>
		<statBases>
			<MaxHitPoints>85</MaxHitPoints>
			<Flammability>1.3</Flammability>
			<Nutrition>0.15</Nutrition>
		</statBases>
		<!-- TEMP PLACEHOLDER: donor texPath (Alpha Biomes' own "Grass_Leafless") does not exist as a loose file anywhere on disk - falling back to a CONFIRMED-valid texture (Alpha Biomes' AB_Aaklac) so this does not render magenta. Mismatched art until fill_queue.py renders land. -->
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Plants/AB_Aaklac</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Random</graphicClass>
		</graphicData>
		<hideAtSnowOrSandDepth>0.5</hideAtSnowOrSandDepth>
		<ingestible/>
		<plant>
			<fertilityMin>0.30</fertilityMin>
			<fertilitySensitivity>0.3</fertilitySensitivity>
			<growDays>2.5</growDays>
			<pollution>Any</pollution>
			<harvestWork>40</harvestWork>
			<maxMeshCount>9</maxMeshCount>
			<visualSizeRange>0.4~0.6</visualSizeRange>
			<topWindExposure>0.4</topWindExposure>
			<wildOrder>1</wildOrder>
		</plant>
	</ThingDef>

	<ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
		<defName>RSW_Scrubgrass</defName>
		<label>scrubgrass</label>
		<description>Wild grass that grows in arid regions where there is little light and minimally fertile ground.</description>
		<statBases>
			<MaxHitPoints>85</MaxHitPoints>
			<Flammability>1.3</Flammability>
			<Nutrition>0.50</Nutrition>
		</statBases>
		<!-- TEMP PLACEHOLDER: donor texPath (ReGrowth's own RG_DesertGrass) does not exist as a loose file - falling back to a CONFIRMED-valid texture (Alpha Biomes' AB_Aaklac) so this does not render magenta. Mismatched art until fill_queue.py renders land. -->
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Plants/AB_Aaklac</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Random</graphicClass>
		</graphicData>
		<hideAtSnowOrSandDepth>0.5</hideAtSnowOrSandDepth>
		<ingestible/>
		<plant>
			<fertilityMin>0.05</fertilityMin>
			<fertilitySensitivity>0.3</fertilitySensitivity>
			<growDays>2.5</growDays>
			<harvestWork>40</harvestWork>
			<maxMeshCount>9</maxMeshCount>
			<visualSizeRange>0.4~0.6</visualSizeRange>
			<topWindExposure>0.4</topWindExposure>
			<wildOrder>1</wildOrder>
			<maxGrowthTemperature>75</maxGrowthTemperature>
		</plant>
	</ThingDef>

	<ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
