		</statBases>
		<!-- TEMP PLACEHOLDER: donor texPath (ReGrowth's own RG_TundraScrubsRed) does not exist as a loose file - falling back to a CONFIRMED-valid texture (Alpha Biomes' AB_Aaklac) so this does not render magenta. Mismatched art until fill_queue.py renders land. -->
