	<ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
		<defName>RSW_Whirlbloom</defName>
		<label>whirlbloom</label>
		<description>A beautiful bluish flower. Prized for its color where it can be found growing wild.</description>
		<!-- TEMP PLACEHOLDER: donor texPath (ReGrowth's own RG_Dervish) does not exist as a loose file - falling back to a CONFIRMED-valid texture (Alpha Biomes' AB_Aaklac) so this does not render magenta. Mismatched art until fill_queue.py renders land. -->
